"""Part 9b-iii mutations: the text box's render (game/text_box.cpp) and the fonts' batching
(game/font.cpp).

Run with the text build: --build build_text.bat --check check_text.py (TEXT_TEST; the "render:"
checks in textbox_test.inc). The deletions are named by the line they delete.

Equivalent (left alive, by design):
  B 1045 cmp            a fifth vertex written past the quad (never drawn or read).
  B 1076 / 1079 / 1133 arith   ReadScreenSize drops its arguments.
  B 1155 / 1157 / 1159 / 1161 / 1163 / 1165 / 1167 / 1169 cmp   an edge at the screen's size or at 0
                        kept as it is either way.
  B 1230 cmp / num      a byte decoded as itself (1 byte) read again as itself (ASCII).
  B 1317 cmp            0 set to 0.
"""
